different models we had.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:06.303
So we have the object
detection model.

00:11:06.303 --> 00:11:07.930
This is our understanding model.

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.720
At the beginning, we said we
can see, understand, and react.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.600
So our object detection model is
where we do our understanding.

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.725
And we're also going be
talking about our commander

00:11:15.725 --> 00:11:18.980
